 "summary": "Six full-wave bridges, each four glass-passivated diodes in the small four-lead MBS surface-mount package. All grades carry 1.0 A average output at a case temperature of 115 °C, take a 35 A single half-sine surge and drop at most 1.1 V per diode at 1.0 A; they differ only in reverse voltage, from 100 V (MB1S) to 1000 V (MB10S). MB10S is the 1000 V grade.",
